# An agent's Markdown as the Android app draws it: a table (its head tinted, rows ruled), TypeScript highlighted, the
# code's long line scrolled sideways by a finger (the list stays), a link held: its menu, 复制链接 (已复制链接).
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 发消息
type 给个表格 {T} md:表格和代码 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
timeout 120000
until 聊天页的列表和输入框
until placeRows
wait 1500
shot 1-markdown
dragon -220 0 500 placeRows
wait 800
shot 2-scrolled
hold 700 example.com/e2e
until =复制链接
shot 3-link-menu
tap =复制链接
until =已复制链接
